`fixCmd c` turns `DState.input (preList L n blocks)` into `DState.input L`: it finds block `1`
(the first non-negative data cell from `3`), walks the forward pointers back into lengths while
counting the blocks (`n`), adds `n` back to block `0`'s entries, and rewrites cells `0, 1, 2`.
For `n = 0` (`pₑ = 2`) it only rewrites cells `0` and `2` (`E = ℓ - 3 - c`).
